    "backstory": "Growing up in Basher's Garage taught Wrench more than just how to strip an engine. He learned how to scrape by, how to make every bit of DRIP count, and how to patch himself up after a scrap. Now, he roams Subchain City, looking for the next big score, leaving a trail of grease and broken bots in his wake.",
